    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.result }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a professional trading analyst AI. Based on the input JSON object representing a trade and the current market price, analyze and determine the following:\n\n1. **trade_status**:  \n   - \"pending\" if the current price has not reached the entry level yet.  \n   - \"on\" if the current price has reached or passed the entry level but hasn't yet hit the stop loss or take profit.  \n   - \"closed\" if the trade has hit either stop loss or take profit.\n\n2. **trade_end**:  \n   - \"tp\" if price reached or exceeded the take profit level.  \n   - \"sl\" if price fell to or below the stop loss level.  \n   - Leave blank if trade is still \"on\" or \"pending\".\n\n3. **profit_loss**:  \n   - Calculate the profit or loss in USD based on the price movement from entry to current price, stop loss, or take profit.\n   - Use the leverage and account balance if necessary for assumptions.\n\n4. **amount_risked**:  \n   - Calculate the risk in USD based on the distance between entry and stop loss.\n\n5. **rr** (Risk to Reward ratio):  \n   - Calculate as:  \n     \\[\n     \\text{RR} = \\frac{\\text{Take Profit - Entry}}{\\text{Entry - Stop Loss}}\n     \\]\n     For BUY trades  \n     (invert for SELL)\n\n6. Always assume the trade was placed at the `entry` price on the `date_time`.\n\nReturn a JSON object with the following required fields filled:\n- trade_status\n- trade_end\n- profit_loss\n- amount_risked\n- rr\n\nEnsure all outputs are numbers with two decimal places, except for status values.\n\nUse this JSON input as your output format reference:\n{\n\"price\": \n\"3363.19\",\n\"row_number\": \n2,\n\"symbol\": \n\"XAU/USD\",\n\"date_time\": \n\"2025-08-01\",\n\"action\": \n\"BUY\",\n\"entry\": \n3366.5,\n\"stop_loss\": \n3360.5,\n\"take_profit\": \n3380,\n\"position_size\": \n\"Determine based on 1% risk rule\",\n\"confidence\": \n\"High\",\n\"timeframe\": \n\"M15\",\n\"trade_status\": \n\"\",\n\"trade_end\": \n\"\",\n\"acct_balance\": \n491.18,\n\"Leverage\": \n\"1:15\",\n\"profit_loss\": \n\"\",\n\"ammt_risked\": \n\"\",\n\"rr\": \n\"\",\n\n}"
        }
      },
